# Editor and IDE state. The project files GoLand writes are one developer's setup —
# window layout, run configurations, the caret's last position — and none of it is part
# of the build: `go build ./cmd/mzs` needs nothing but the module.
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Build and coverage output, all reproducible from the source.
/mzs
coverage.out
